            <span style="background: #e1e8ed; padding: 5px 15px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.9rem;">SAP</span>
            <span style="background: #e1e8ed; padding: 5px 15px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.9rem;">Budgeting</span>
            <span style="background: #e1e8ed; padding: 5px 15px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.9rem;">Financial Analysis</span>
            <span style="background: #e1e8ed; padding: 5px 15px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 0.9rem;">Strategic Planning</span>
